<title>SINGAPORE: GPE full year net profit up 19.16 pct.</title>
<headline>GPE full year net profit up 19.16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		14.13    vs   11.86</p>
<p>    Final dividend(cts)    1.80    vs    2.00</p>
<p>    Group share (cts)	7.07    vs    7.03</p>
<p>    Turnover		 193.64    vs  176.49</p>
<p>    Interest expense	 0.21    vs    1.26</p>
<p>    Depreciation	     4.66    vs    2.74</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 9.00    vs    7.90</p>
<p>    Associates		 6.84    vs    5.71</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.70    vs    1.25</p>
<p>Note -  GPE Industries Ltd, a maker of automotive electronic products, said its cable and harness division continued to perform strongly and contributed significantly to earnings.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
